    <custom_item>
      type        : REGISTRY_SETTING
      description : "18.10.10.2.6 Ensure 'Choose how BitLocker-protected operating system drives can be recovered: Recovery Key' is set to 'Enabled: Do not allow 256-bit recovery key'"
